{
  "_comment": [
    "GitHub repository ruleset for the pilot repo's default branch. Apply with:",
    "  gh api -X POST repos/shin1ohno/ai-memory/rulesets --input spine-github/rulesets/main-protection.json",
    "Read back with:",
    "  gh api repos/shin1ohno/ai-memory/rulesets --jq '.[] | {id, name, enforcement}'",
    "",
    "Filled for ai-memory: the CI check is ai-memory-ci (ai-memory's own test job, as",
    "it appears in the checks list — the job name, not the workflow name). Every other",
    "value is deliberate; the notes below say why.",
    "",
    "Security-floor mapping (README section 0, item 7):",
    "  human review before merge      -> pull_request.required_approving_review_count = 1",
    "  agent identity cannot approve  -> require_last_push_approval = true, bypass_actors = []",
    "  feature branches only          -> deletion + non_fast_forward on the default branch",
    "  envelope is binding            -> required_status_checks includes 'guard'",
    "",
    "'guard' is the job id of the required check in .github/workflows/envelope-guard.yml.",
    "Rename the job and this context must be renamed with it, or the gate silently stops",
    "being required."
  ],
  "name": "main protection (agentic pilot)",
  "target": "branch",
  "enforcement": "active",
  "bypass_actors": [],
  "conditions": {
    "ref_name": {
      "include": ["~DEFAULT_BRANCH"],
      "exclude": []
    }
  },
  "rules": [
    {
      "type": "deletion"
    },
    {
      "type": "non_fast_forward"
    },
    {
      "type": "required_linear_history"
    },
    {
      "type": "pull_request",
      "parameters": {
        "required_approving_review_count": 1,
        "dismiss_stale_reviews_on_push": true,
        "require_code_owner_review": false,
        "require_last_push_approval": true,
        "required_review_thread_resolution": true,
        "allowed_merge_methods": ["squash"]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "required_status_checks",
      "parameters": {
        "strict_required_status_checks_policy": true,
        "do_not_enforce_on_create": false,
        "required_status_checks": [
          {
            "context": "guard"
          },
          {
            "context": "ai-memory-ci"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
